# Copy to `.env` (git-ignored) at the REPOSITORY ROOT — the single home for
# development credentials. The guide dev container reads it as compose's
# `env_file` (workloads/guide/compose.yaml), so the values reach the process
# without being written into any tracked file. Keep lines as plain KEY=value
# — no quotes, no $expansion.
#
# Worktree protocol: when a new worktree is created under .worktrees/, the
# root repository's .env is copied into it, so parallel worktrees start with
# working credentials.

# OpenAI standing key for `plggpress dev`'s voice editing panel: the dev
# server mints SHORT-LIVED Realtime session keys from it, and the panel stays
# dark when it is unset. It never reaches a browser or the repo.
OPENAI_API_KEY=
